ory_count":2},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Food, Restaurants","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"sXSUzImYOcRRI3xtG2M85g","review_id":"jQO-GjFiSui1wKzRtO3mNQ","date":"2018-07-01T14:41:43","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9402810335159302,"text_excerpt":"I just visited this coffee shop for the first time this morning and I'm happy to say this won't be my last visit. The shop was aesthetically pleasing, to say the least. It was so bright and airy, not dark and cramped like a lot of the coffee shops that I've been to in the past. The iced coffee was excellent. I also had their peanut butter/banana/honey sandwich....DE-LI-CIOUS!! Now, the bread that they used was very firm and may be too hard for some but I liked it. In this case, a sturdy bread was needed to avoid having a super messy meal and the flavor was really good. The staff was friendly and the prices were very reasonable. Not to mention, the place was super clean (a definite plus an..."},{"business_id":"sXSUzImYOcRRI3xtG2M85g","review_id":"FqF64pdKw_1WJysLDI6wmA","date":"2020-09-01T00:05:06","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9326393008232117,"text_excerpt":"This place is amazing. They have some of the best coffee I've ever tasted and such delicious pastries. Their coolinary menu is an awesome five course brunch. I really loved their tomato basil soup and sweet potato pie but I also completely recommend their limoncello cake. There isn't a parking lot but lots of street parking. Loved the decor and aesthetics, fresh flowers are always an added bonus. It is pretty place to meet friends, study, or just have a great meal."},{"business_id":"sXSUzImYOcRRI3xtG2M85g","review_id":"JmSqbNrZ8nVjTMqalHp09Q","date":"2019-02-10T21:30:25","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9289243221282959,"text_excerpt":"I have a new favorite coffee shop down here. It's not far from NOAC so I can go there after the gym. The price is reasonable, the coffee is good but the food--oh the food is great. That grilled cheese with raspberry jam still makes my mouth water when I think about it and it's been a couple hours since I ate it. The atmosphere is comfortable, plenty of space, and one happy morning out with friends. Oh yeah and the service was fantastic--the women behind the counter went above and beyond I wish I got their names so I could give them a shoutout on here and help them get a raise."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"sXSUzImYOcRRI3xtG2M85g","photo_id":"2uZxK6V3PyGMmm5ofLFBwg","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/2uZxK6V3PyGMmm5ofLFBwg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.846865177154541},{"business_id":"sXSUzImYOcRRI3xtG2M85g","photo_id":"MD8B1J2TvWw3IiWd-R9tdQ","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/MD8B1J2TvWw3IiWd-R9tdQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8268704414367676},{"business_id":"sXSUzImYOcRRI3xtG2M85g","photo_id":"_0en7anTfclMfelTiANFLw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/_0en7anTfclMfelTiANFLw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8072090744972229},{"business_id":"sXSUzImYOcRRI3xtG2M85g","photo_id":"u4oQ5V6lYWYoMzCi0_cUUg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/u4oQ5V6lYWYoMzCi0_cUUg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7582937479019165},{"business_id":"sXSUzImYOcRRI3xtG2M85